      "text": "c. οἱ σοφοὶ δοκοῦσί τι εἰδέναι, οὐκ εἰδότες.\nThe wise men seem to know something, although they do not.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": {
        "id": "1b",
        "instruction": null,
        "items": [
