        831
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "e. Σωκράτης, ὡς ἐγὼ οἶμαι, οὐ πειρᾶται διαφθείρειν τοὺς νέους.\nSocrates, as I see it, is not trying to corrupt the young men.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": {
